WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.714 --> 00:00:07.850
♪ ♪

00:00:07.851 --> 00:00:09.452
&gt;&gt; Tucker: ANOTHER MIGRANT

00:00:09.453 --> 00:00:10.152
CARAVAN FROM CENTRAL AMERICA

00:00:10.153 --> 00:00:12.087
MAKING ITS WAY TO OUR SOUTHERN

00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:14.256
BORDER, IT'S A MASS OF ABOUT A

00:00:14.257 --> 00:00:15.658
THOUSAND PEOPLE.

00:00:15.659 --> 00:00:17.026
THEY CROSSED FROM HONDURAS INTO

00:00:17.027 --> 00:00:17.693
GUATEMALA.

00:00:17.694 --> 00:00:18.828
IF THE PRESIDENT RESPONDED ON

00:00:18.829 --> 00:00:20.863
TWITTER TO ALL OF THIS.

00:00:20.864 --> 00:00:23.132
HE SAID "THE UNITED STATES HAS

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:24.633
STRONGLY INFORMED THE

00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:25.434
PRESIDENT OF HONDURAS AT THE

00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:26.769
LARGE CARAVAN OF PEOPLE HEADED

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.070
TO THE U.S. IS NOT STOPPED AND

00:00:28.071 --> 00:00:29.839
BROUGHT BACK, NO MORE MONEY OR

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.574
IT WILL BE GIVEN TO HONDURAS

00:00:31.575 --> 00:00:33.642
EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY.

00:00:33.643 --> 00:00:34.376
THAT THREAT MAY HAVE WORKED IN

00:00:34.377 --> 00:00:40.216
THE SHORT TERM, GUATEMALA

00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:40.950
AUTHORITIES SAY THEY HAVE

00:00:40.951 --> 00:00:42.318
ARRESTED THE LEADER AND HAVE

00:00:42.319 --> 00:00:46.655
DEPORTED HIM BACK TO HONDURAS.

00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:48.324
WELL VERSED IN INTERNATIONAL LAW

00:00:48.325 --> 00:00:49.592
AND THE POLITICS OF CENTRAL

00:00:49.593 --> 00:00:52.027
AMERICA, HE IS A REGISTERED

00:00:52.028 --> 00:00:52.795
FOREIGN AGENT FOR THE GOVERNMENT

00:00:52.796 --> 00:00:54.964
OF EL SALVADOR.

00:00:54.965 --> 00:00:58.934
WHY IS THAT NOT EXACTLY THE

00:00:58.935 --> 00:01:00.970
RESPONSE EVERY PRESIDENT OUGHT

00:01:00.971 --> 00:01:02.471
TO GIVE ONE A FOREIGN COUNTRY

00:01:02.472 --> 00:01:04.640
ATTEMPTS A KIND OF INVASION.

00:01:04.641 --> 00:01:06.008
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE EVERY RIGHT TO

00:01:06.009 --> 00:01:07.042
PROTECT OUR BORDER AND WE DON'T

00:01:07.043 --> 00:01:09.144
HAVE TO LET ANY OF THESE

00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:09.678
MIGRANTS IN.

00:01:09.679 --> 00:01:11.947
IF THE GOAL IS FOR THEM NOT TO

00:01:11.948 --> 00:01:13.549
COME HERE, WE SHOULD NOT BE

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.484
CUTTING OFF FOREIGN AID TO

00:01:15.485 --> 00:01:15.851
HONDURAS.

00:01:15.852 --> 00:01:18.287
HONDURAS IS GETTING THAT AID AND

00:01:18.288 --> 00:01:20.656
WE CAN HELP IMPROVE THE ECONOMY.

00:01:20.657 --> 00:01:22.224
THE REASON THESE PEOPLE ARE

00:01:22.225 --> 00:01:23.425
LEAVING HONDURAS IS BECAUSE THE

00:01:23.426 --> 00:01:25.861
ECONOMY IS TERRIBLE IN THERE ARE

00:01:25.862 --> 00:01:26.629
NO JOBS.

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:27.730
THESE ARE ECONOMIC REFUGEES AND

00:01:27.731 --> 00:01:29.431
THE REASON THEY ARE TRYING TO

00:01:29.432 --> 00:01:30.132
COME TO THE U.S. IS THEY ARE

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:34.036
LOOKING FOR A BETTER LIFE.

00:01:34.037 --> 00:01:35.271
IN THE LONG TERM IF WE DON'T

00:01:35.272 --> 00:01:36.972
WANT THEM TO COME WE HAVE TO TRY

00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:38.908
TO WORK WITH HONDURAS AND THE

00:01:38.909 --> 00:01:40.142
OTHER COUNTRIES IN

00:01:40.143 --> 00:01:41.544
CENTRAL AMERICA TO IMPROVE THEIR

00:01:41.545 --> 00:01:42.645
ECONOMIES SO PEOPLE STAY.

00:01:42.646 --> 00:01:44.413
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW IS THAT WORKING

00:01:44.414 --> 00:01:45.447
FOR US?

00:01:45.448 --> 00:01:47.516
WE'VE GIVEN A LOT OF AID TO

00:01:47.517 --> 00:01:49.251
EL SALVADOR, ONE-THIRD OF ALL

00:01:49.252 --> 00:01:50.653
EL SALVADOR ENDS ON THE PLANET

00:01:50.654 --> 00:01:52.154
LIVE IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:01:52.155 --> 00:01:54.189
ONE-THIRD OF ALL EXISTING

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:55.624
SALVADORANS.

00:01:55.625 --> 00:01:57.426
PHILLY EVERYTHING WE'VE DONE FOR

00:01:57.427 --> 00:01:58.327
SALVADOR HASN'T STOPPED THE FLOW

00:01:58.328 --> 00:02:00.062
OF ONE-THIRD OF THE ENTIRE

00:02:00.063 --> 00:02:02.231
POPULATION INTO OUR COUNTRY.

00:02:02.232 --> 00:02:02.765
IT DOESN'T WORK.

00:02:02.766 --> 00:02:05.634
WHY DON'T WE SAY LOOK, WE'RE

00:02:05.635 --> 00:02:07.803
GOING TO PUNISH YOU PERSONALLY

00:02:07.804 --> 00:02:08.871
IF YOU LET THIS CONTINUE, WHY IS

00:02:08.872 --> 00:02:10.539
THAT A BAD IDEA?

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.808
&gt;&gt; WE HAVEN'T GIVEN VERY MUCH

00:02:12.809 --> 00:02:14.343
MONEY TO CENTRAL AMERICA.

00:02:14.344 --> 00:02:17.012
KEEP IN MIND, WE GIVE ABOUT 1%

00:02:17.013 --> 00:02:18.814
OF OUR BUDGET OVERALL IN FOREIGN

00:02:18.815 --> 00:02:19.381
AID AROUND THE WORLD.

00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:22.484
A VERY SMALL AMOUNT OF THAT GOES

00:02:22.485 --> 00:02:24.553
TO CENTRAL AMERICA.

00:02:24.554 --> 00:02:27.256
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOLD ON.

00:02:27.257 --> 00:02:29.425
WHY DO WE GIVE ANY?

00:02:29.426 --> 00:02:30.659
ONE-THIRD OF ALL SALVADORANS

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.360
LIVE IN OUR COUNTRY A LOT OF

00:02:31.361 --> 00:02:32.494
THEM ILLEGALLY AND I'M SURE

00:02:32.495 --> 00:02:36.432
THEY'RE ALL GREAT PEOPLE, I'M

00:02:36.433 --> 00:02:37.833
NOT ATTACKING THEM.

00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:39.034
I'M SAYING THIS ARRANGEMENT

00:02:39.035 --> 00:02:39.501
ISN'T WORKING.

00:02:39.502 --> 00:02:40.569
THEY ARE OFF-LOADING THEIR POUR

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.438
INTO OUR COUNTRY AT A TIME WHEN

00:02:42.439 --> 00:02:44.340
WORKING-CLASS JOBS ARE GOING

00:02:44.341 --> 00:02:45.741
AWAY DUE TO AUTOMATION, THEIR

00:02:45.742 --> 00:02:47.076
BENEFIT AND, WE ARE LOSING AND

00:02:47.077 --> 00:02:49.311
PAYING THEM.

00:02:49.312 --> 00:02:51.647
&gt;&gt; I JUST EXPLAIN THAT TO YOU.

00:02:51.648 --> 00:02:53.248
THE REASON WE ARE GIVING AID IS

00:02:53.249 --> 00:02:54.416
TO HELP IMPROVE THOSE COUNTRIES

00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:56.051
SO THAT PEOPLE STAY -- THAT'S

00:02:56.052 --> 00:02:57.419
THE LONG TERM GOAL.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.788
I THINK YOU AND I BOTH AGREE IT

00:02:59.789 --> 00:03:00.356
WITH THAT AS DO MANY

00:03:00.357 --> 00:03:02.491
POLICYMAKERS IN WASHINGTON.

00:03:02.492 --> 00:03:04.860
WE HAVEN'T DONE A GOOD ENOUGH

00:03:04.861 --> 00:03:05.227
JOB.

00:03:05.228 --> 00:03:05.794
NEITHER DEMOCRATS NOR

00:03:05.795 --> 00:03:06.729
REPUBLICANS HAVE DONE A GOOD

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.831
ENOUGH JOB OF HELPING THESE

00:03:08.832 --> 00:03:10.232
COUNTRIES IMPROVE THEIR

00:03:10.233 --> 00:03:10.866
ECONOMIES, HELPING THESE

00:03:10.867 --> 00:03:11.600
COUNTRIES IMPROVE THE RULE OF

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:14.536
LAW SO PEOPLE DON'T LEAVE.

00:03:14.537 --> 00:03:18.407
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IS NOT TRUE.

00:03:18.408 --> 00:03:21.010
MEXICO HAS JUMPED MORE THAN TEN

00:03:21.011 --> 00:03:21.844
SPOTS ON THE ECONOMIC

00:03:21.845 --> 00:03:22.678
DEVELOPMENT LIST

00:03:22.679 --> 00:03:23.145
INTERNATIONALLY.

00:03:23.146 --> 00:03:24.813
I THINK IS NOW NUMBER 11.

00:03:24.814 --> 00:03:26.815
WE'VE MADE MEXICO RICH WITH

00:03:26.816 --> 00:03:27.850
TRADE.

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:29.852
BILLIONS AND BILLIONS OF

00:03:29.853 --> 00:03:30.653
DOLLARS, MILLIONS OF JOBS.

00:03:30.654 --> 00:03:33.522
AND YET WE STILL HAVE 22 MILLION

00:03:33.523 --> 00:03:34.423
PEOPLE IN THIS COUNTRY

00:03:34.424 --> 00:03:36.258
ILLEGALLY, THE MAJORITY OF THE

00:03:36.259 --> 00:03:36.825
MEXICAN.

00:03:36.826 --> 00:03:38.260
I'M NOT ATTACKING MEXICO OR

00:03:38.261 --> 00:03:40.029
MEXICAN PEOPLE, I'M SAYING WE'VE

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.030
MADE IN MEXICO RICHER THAN IT

00:03:41.031 --> 00:03:42.798
WAS AND WE STILL HAVE AN INFLOW

00:03:42.799 --> 00:03:44.833
FROM MEXICO.

00:03:44.834 --> 00:03:45.868
WE'RE NOT GETTING ANYTHING OUT

00:03:45.869 --> 00:03:46.201
OF THIS.

00:03:46.202 --> 00:03:48.404
&gt;&gt; THAT'S A GREAT EXAMPLE.

00:03:48.405 --> 00:03:50.205
YES WE ARE BECAUSE FAR LESS

00:03:50.206 --> 00:03:50.839
IMMIGRANTS ARE COMING FROM

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.641
MEXICO RIGHT NOW.

00:03:52.642 --> 00:03:54.043
YOU REFER TO IMMIGRANTS THAT ARE

00:03:54.044 --> 00:03:54.877
ALREADY HERE FROM MEXICO MANY OF

00:03:54.878 --> 00:03:58.280
WHOM CAME A LONG TIME AGO.

00:03:58.281 --> 00:04:01.550
BEFORE THE BENEFITS OF NAFTA

00:04:01.551 --> 00:04:02.017
WENT IN PLACE.

00:04:02.018 --> 00:04:04.620
IF YOU LOOK AT THE DATA WE DON'T

00:04:04.621 --> 00:04:06.055
GET MANY IMMIGRANTS FROM MEXICO.

00:04:06.056 --> 00:04:07.556
EVEN YOUR EXAMPLE WERE TALKING

00:04:07.557 --> 00:04:08.757
ABOUT TODAY IS MIGRANTS FROM

00:04:08.758 --> 00:04:14.930
HONDURAS, NOT FROM MEXICO.

00:04:14.931 --> 00:04:18.000
THERE ENJOYING THE BENEFITS OF

00:04:18.001 --> 00:04:19.001
NAFTA IN CANDIDLY SUPPORTING

00:04:19.002 --> 00:04:19.468
THEIR FAMILIES.

00:04:19.469 --> 00:04:22.237
IT'S A GREAT EXAMPLE.

00:04:22.238 --> 00:04:23.072
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SINCE YOU YEARS AND

00:04:23.073 --> 00:04:27.209
THE DATA, LET ME REFER YOU TO

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:28.811
THE ESSENTIAL DATUM IN THIS

00:04:28.812 --> 00:04:29.244
CONVERSATION.

00:04:29.245 --> 00:04:31.113
WE HAVE MORE THAN 10 MILLION

00:04:31.114 --> 00:04:33.215
MEXICAN CITIZENS LIVING IN OUR

00:04:33.216 --> 00:04:34.416
BORDERS ILLEGALLY, ONCE AGAIN

00:04:34.417 --> 00:04:36.218
I'M NOT ATTACKING THEM, BUT IF

00:04:36.219 --> 00:04:37.553
THE MODEL YOU'RE PROPOSING WORKS

00:04:37.554 --> 00:04:39.021
AND WE BOTH KNOW THAT IT DOESN'T

00:04:39.022 --> 00:04:40.589
IT'S ALL A JOKE, IT'S A HUGE LIE

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.858
THE WHOLE POINT IS TO MAKE THE

00:04:42.859 --> 00:04:45.027
DEMOCRATIC PARTY MORE POWERFUL,

00:04:45.028 --> 00:04:45.994
LET'S PLAY ALONG -- IF YOUR

00:04:45.995 --> 00:04:47.663
MODEL WORKS THEN WHY ARE THEY

00:04:47.664 --> 00:04:48.330
STILL HEAR?

00:04:48.331 --> 00:04:49.698
WHY HAVEN'T THEY GONE BACK TO

00:04:49.699 --> 00:04:53.502
THE NEWLY ENRICHED MEXICO WHICH

00:04:53.503 --> 00:04:54.203
WE ENRICHED WITH OUR MONEY AND

00:04:54.204 --> 00:04:56.038
OUR JOBS.

00:04:56.039 --> 00:04:57.339
&gt;&gt; MANY CAME FROM A LONG TIME

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.141
AGO.

00:04:59.142 --> 00:05:01.310
THE DATA I'M REFERRING TO IS A

00:05:01.311 --> 00:05:02.544
LEGAL IMMIGRATION FROM MEXICO

00:05:02.545 --> 00:05:03.712
HAS GONE DOWN, YOU AGREE WITH ME

00:05:03.713 --> 00:05:05.814
ON THAT RIGHT?

00:05:05.815 --> 00:05:08.617
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'M MISSING IT.

00:05:08.618 --> 00:05:10.753
THE DATA AS YOU SAID SHOW THAT

00:05:10.754 --> 00:05:11.687
MEXICO IS WAY RICHER THAN IT WAS

00:05:11.688 --> 00:05:13.422
20 YEARS AGO.

00:05:13.423 --> 00:05:15.824
WE DID THAT, WE SUFFERED AS A

00:05:15.825 --> 00:05:17.259
RESULT OF THAT BUT WE ALSO GOT

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.594
ALL OF THEIR POOR PEOPLE WHO

00:05:18.595 --> 00:05:20.395
THEY DIDN'T FEEL LIKE SUPPORTING

00:05:20.396 --> 00:05:21.130
WITH THEIR NONEXISTENT SOCIAL

00:05:21.131 --> 00:05:23.432
SAFETY NET SO THEY CAN MAKE MORE

00:05:23.433 --> 00:05:24.099
BILLIONAIRES WHICH THEY HAVE

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.001
ASSIDUOUSLY DONE.

00:05:26.002 --> 00:05:27.002
WE GET SHAFTED, WE ARE PAYING

00:05:27.003 --> 00:05:28.203
FOR THE HEALTH CARE OF THEIR

00:05:28.204 --> 00:05:29.037
POOREST PEOPLE YOU DON'T SEE

00:05:29.038 --> 00:05:31.106
WHAT I'M TALKING ABOUT AT ALL?

00:05:31.107 --> 00:05:33.942
&gt;&gt; YOUR POINT DOESN'T MAKE SENS

00:05:33.943 --> 00:05:34.243
SENSE.

00:05:34.244 --> 00:05:35.744
WERE TALKING ABOUT ILLEGAL

00:05:35.745 --> 00:05:37.446
IMMIGRATION AND IT HAS GONE DOWN

00:05:37.447 --> 00:05:38.413
FOR MEXICO.

00:05:38.414 --> 00:05:40.816
IT COULD GO DOWN FOR HONDURAS

00:05:40.817 --> 00:05:41.416
AND GUATEMALA AND OTHER

00:05:41.417 --> 00:05:43.418
COUNTRIES IN CENTRAL AMERICA

00:05:43.419 --> 00:05:45.454
JUST AS WE HELPED IMPROVE THOSE

00:05:45.455 --> 00:05:45.821
ECONOMIES.

00:05:45.822 --> 00:05:47.723
WE ONLY GET A LITTLE BIT OF

00:05:47.724 --> 00:05:49.758
MONEY, LET'S HELP IMPROVE THOSE

00:05:49.759 --> 00:05:50.626
ECONOMIES.

00:05:50.627 --> 00:05:52.127
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE NEED TO PAY

00:05:52.128 --> 00:05:53.596
MORE.

